  "app_review_info": {
    "notes": "Pausely helps people keep track of their subscriptions and avoid surprise renewals. FREE: track up to 2 subscriptions with renewal reminders. PRO (auto-renewing subscription): unlimited subscriptions, savings insights, cheaper-alternative suggestions and the guided cancel flow. Subscription auto-renews unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the period; manage or cancel in Settings > Apple ID > Subscriptions. Sign in with Apple or email is available; a review account is provided in the App Review Information section of App Store Connect (credentials are NOT stored in this repository).",
